Charmander:

Charmander, small orange fire Pokémon with textured scales, cream belly, big expressive turquoise eyes, white claws. 

He stands firmly on two legs in a beautiful forest clearing during golden hour, then performs an impressive exhibition Flamethrower attack: crouches slightly, opens mouth wide and shoots a powerful continuous stream of bright orange-yellow flames with blue core forward in a dramatic arc, intense heat haze, glowing embers and sparks flying everywhere. His tail flame grows much larger and burns intensely.

Fluid dynamic motion, realistic physics, natural gravity, fire illuminating the trees with warm volumetric light.

