Jiggupuff
Jigglypuff, small round pink Pokémon with smooth soft skin, big bright blue eyes, tiny cat-like ears, and a signature curl of hair on its forehead.

It stands gently in a beautiful forest clearing during golden hour, then performs an impressive exhibition attack: it inhales deeply, closes its eyes, and begins to sing melodically. As it sings, visible glowing sound waves ripple outward in soft pink and pastel tones, expanding through the air in smooth circular pulses. The environment reacts—leaves tremble, light vibrates subtly, and nearby creatures slowly fall asleep. A magical aura surrounds Jigglypuff, with floating sparkles and soft particles drifting in the air.

