MEW
Mew, small mythical pink Pokémon with smooth soft skin, large bright blue eyes, tiny limbs, and a long thin tail.

He floats gracefully in a beautiful forest clearing during golden hour, then performs an impressive exhibition double attack: first, he closes his eyes and gathers intense psychic energy, his body glowing with a radiant pink-purple aura. The air distorts as telekinetic force lifts leaves, dust, and small rocks around him, then he releases a powerful Psystrike—launching a concentrated sphere of psychic energy forward in a shimmering arc, leaving ripples that bend light. Immediately after, he spins playfully in mid-air and channels a second attack: a brilliant multicolored energy beam erupts forward (Hyper Beam), wide and overwhelming, blasting through the air with explosive force, creating shockwaves, glowing particles, and scattering debris everywhere.

Fluid dynamic motion, realistic physics, natural gravity, psychic distortions and energy beams illuminating the trees with vibrant volumetric light.

