GASTLY
Gastly, small ghost-like Pokémon consisting of a dark spherical core with large expressive eyes and a wide mischievous mouth, surrounded by a swirling purple-black gaseous aura.

It floats eerily in a beautiful forest clearing during golden hour, then performs an impressive exhibition double attack: first, its gaseous body expands and darkens as it gathers shadowy energy, the surrounding air chilling and distorting, then it releases a powerful Shadow Ball—launching a dense sphere of dark purple-black energy forward, pulsing with ominous light and leaving a smoky, rippling trail. Immediately after, it spins slowly and its aura thickens, transitioning into a second attack: it spreads a haunting wave of ghostly energy (Lick-like spectral extension), forming a semi-transparent, elongated spectral tongue that lashes outward with eerie fluidity, leaving behind trails of misty particles and chilling distortions in the air.

